  "claim": "This film featured the actor who was a member of a Chicago comedy troupe. Dana Carvey costarred in the film.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Wayne's World (film). Sentence: It also features Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, and Alice Cooper.\nPage: Chris Farley. Sentence: Farley was known for his loud, energetic comedic style, and was a member of Chicago's Second City Theatre and later a cast member of the NBC sketch comedy show \"Saturday Night Live\" between 1990 and 1995.\nPage: Dana Carvey. Sentence: Dana Thomas Carvey (born June 2, 1955) is an American actor and stand-up comedian, who is most widely known for his work as a cast member on \"Saturday Night Live\" (1986–1993) and for playing the role of Garth Algar in the \"Wayne's World\" (1992) and its sequel \"Wayne's World 2\" (1993).",
